# AARMA environment template.
#
# Copy to `.env` and edit. `.env` is git-ignored and must never be committed.
# AARMA reads these from the process environment; nothing here is required for
# the Phase 1 foundation to run.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- data root
# Where AARMA keeps config.json, aarma.db, logs and screenshots.
# Leave unset to use the per-user default (%APPDATA%\AARMA on Windows).
# Set to ./data for a fully portable checkout that writes nothing outside the
# project folder.
#
# AARMA_HOME=./data

# -------------------------------------------------------- AI provider keys
# Phase 1 ships no language model and reads no key. These names are reserved so
# the Phase 2 provider layer has a documented place to look.
#
# NEVER commit real keys. Never paste one into an issue or a screenshot.
#
# AARMA_LLM_PROVIDER=none
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
